<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Usuarios | LoginPro</title>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/public/favicon-loginpro.svg" />
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    :root {
      --bg: #f4f5f7;
      --surface: #fff;
      --surface-2: #f8fafc;
      --border: #e1e4e8;
      --text: #1a1d23;
      --muted: #6b7280;
      --navy: #1e2d3d;
      --teal: #0d7a6b;
      --teal-soft: #f0fdfa;
      --success-bg: #ecfdf5;
      --success-border: #a7f3d0;
      --success-text: #166534;
      --error-bg: #fef2f2;
      --error-border: #fecaca;
      --error-text: #b91c1c;
    }
    body { margin: 0; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); font-size: 14px; }
    .navbar { min-height: 52px; background: var(--navy); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 18px; padding: 0 24px; }
    .navbar a { color: #cbd5e0; text-decoration: none; }
    .navbar .brand img { height: 28px; display: block; }
    .navbar .spacer { flex: 1; }
    .page { max-width: 1180px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 28px 20px 60px; display: grid; gap: 18px; }
    .page-header h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 22px; color: var(--navy); }
    .page-header p { margin: 6px 0 0; color: var(--muted); max-width: 850px; line-height: 1.5; }
    .card { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px; box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.06); }
    .card h2 { margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 16px; color: var(--navy); }
    .hint { color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.45; }
    .flash { border-radius: 10px; padding: 11px 13px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.45; }
    .flash-success { background: var(--success-bg); border: 1px solid var(--success-border); color: var(--success-text); }
    .flash-error { background: var(--error-bg); border: 1px solid var(--error-border); color: var(--error-text); }
    .recovery-code { margin-top: 8px; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .08em; }
    .create-user-form { margin-top: 14px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 12px; }
    .create-section { grid-column: 1 / -1; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 10px; padding: 14px; display: grid; gap: 12px; background: #fcfdff; }
    .create-section-title { margin: 0; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; color: #334155; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .06em; }
    .create-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 12px; }
    .field { display: grid; gap: 6px; min-width: 0; }
    .field.full { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
    .field label, .field > span:first-child { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 750; color: var(--navy); }
    .field input, .field select { width: 100%; min-width: 0; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 8px; padding: 10px 11px; font: inherit; color: var(--text); background: #fff; }
    .field input:focus, .field select:focus { outline: 2px solid rgba(13,122,107,.18); border-color: var(--teal); }
    .scope-options { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 7px; padding: 9px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 9px; background: #fff; max-height: 230px; overflow: auto; }
    .scope-option { display: flex !important; align-items: flex-start; gap: 8px; padding: 7px 8px; border-radius: 7px; cursor: pointer; font-size: 13px !important; font-weight: 500 !important; }
    .scope-option:hover { background: var(--teal-soft); }
    .scope-option input { width: 16px !important; min-width: 16px; height: 16px; margin: 1px 0 0; padding: 0; accent-color: var(--teal); }
    .scope-vacancy-list { display: grid; gap: 8px; }
    .scope-vacancy-group { border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 9px; padding: 9px; background: #fff; }
    .scope-vacancy-group strong { display: block; margin-bottom: 5px; color: var(--navy); font-size: 12px; }
    .create-permissions { display: grid; gap: 10px; }
    .create-user-actions { grid-column: 1 / -1; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .supervisor-users-list { display: grid; gap: 10px; margin-top: 14px; }
    .supervisor-user { border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; background: #fff; }
    .supervisor-user > summary { cursor: pointer; padding: 13px 14px; font-weight: 750; background: var(--surface-2); }
    .supervisor-user-body { padding: 14px; display: grid; gap: 12px; }
    .supervisor-module { border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px; display: grid; gap: 8px; }
    .supervisor-module-title { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 9px; cursor: pointer; }
    .supervisor-module-title input { margin-top: 2px; width: 17px; height: 17px; accent-color: var(--teal); }
    .supervisor-module-title strong { display: block; color: var(--navy); }
    .supervisor-module-title small { display: block; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 2px; }
    .supervisor-module-functions { display: grid; gap: 6px; padding-left: 26px; }
    .supervisor-function { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 8px; padding: 6px 8px; border-radius: 7px; background: var(--teal-soft); }
    .supervisor-function input { margin-top: 2px; width: 16px; height: 16px; accent-color: var(--teal); }
    .supervisor-function span { display: grid; gap: 2px; }
    .supervisor-function small { color: var(--muted); }
    .supervisor-actions { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .btn { border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; padding: 9px 13px; cursor: pointer; font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; background: #fff; color: var(--text); }
    .btn-primary { background: var(--teal); border-color: var(--teal); color: #fff; }
    .btn:disabled { opacity: .55; cursor: not-allowed; }
    .status-success { color: #166534; }
    .status-error { color: #b91c1c; }
    .empty { padding: 22px 8px; text-align: center; color: var(--muted); }
    [hidden] { display: none !important; }
    @media (max-width: 720px) {
      .page { padding: 18px 12px 40px; }
      .create-user-form, .create-grid, .scope-options { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .create-user-actions { grid-column: auto; }
      .supervisor-module-functions { padding-left: 8px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <nav class="navbar">
    <a class="brand" href="/admin" aria-label="LoginPro"><img src="/public/logo-loginpro.svg" alt="LoginPro" /></a>
    <a href="/admin">Candidatos</a>
    <a href="/admin/operaciones">Operaciones / Despacho</a>
    <span class="spacer"></span>
    <form method="post" action="/logout"><button type="submit">Cerrar sesión</button></form>
  </nav>

  <main class="page">
    <div class="page-header">
      <h1>Usuarios</h1>
      <p>Administra usuarios Consulta, su alcance territorial y sus permisos operativos. DEV conserva exclusivamente la asignación y el cambio del rol Supervisor.</p>
    </div>

    <% if (successMsg) { %>
      <div class="flash flash-success"><%= successMsg %><% if (revealedRecoveryCode) { %><div class="recovery-code">Código de recuperación: <%= revealedRecoveryCode %></div><% } %></div>
    <% } %>
    <% if (errorMsg) { %>
      <div class="flash flash-error"><%= errorMsg %></div>
    <% } %>

    <%
      const scopeOptions = creationScopeOptions || { actorScope: 'VACANCY', canCreateAll: false, allowedCities: [], allowedVacancies: [] };
      const allowedCities = scopeOptions.allowedCities || [];
      const allowedVacancies = scopeOptions.allowedVacancies || [];
      const defaultScope = scopeOptions.canCreateAll ? 'ALL' : (scopeOptions.actorScope === 'CITY' ? 'CITY' : 'VACANCY');
      const preselectActorScope = !scopeOptions.canCreateAll;
    %>

    <section class="card" data-supervisor-user-create="true">
      <h2>Crear usuario</h2>
      <p class="hint">Crea el usuario Consulta y deja definidos desde el inicio su alcance, módulos y funciones. Nunca podrás asignar el rol Supervisor desde esta pantalla.</p>
      <form class="create-user-form" method="post" action="/admin/locations/users/create" autocomplete="off" data-supervisor-create-form="true">
        <section class="create-section">
          <h3 class="create-section-title">Identidad</h3>
          <div class="create-grid">
            <div class="field">
              <label for="supervisorCreateDisplayName">Nombre completo</label>
              <input id="supervisorCreateDisplayName" name="displayName" type="text" minlength="3" maxlength="160" required autocomplete="name" />
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label for="supervisorCreateEmail">Correo electrónico</label>
              <input id="supervisorCreateEmail" name="email" type="email" maxlength="254" required autocomplete="email" />
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label for="supervisorCreatePassword">Contraseña inicial</label>
              <input id="supervisorCreatePassword" name="password" type="password" minlength="6" required autocomplete="new-password" />
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label for="supervisorCreateRecoveryPhone">Teléfono de recuperación <span class="hint">(opcional)</span></label>
              <input id="supervisorCreateRecoveryPhone" name="recoveryPhone" type="tel" maxlength="40" autocomplete="tel" />
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="create-section">
          <h3 class="create-section-title">Alcance</h3>
          <div class="create-grid">
            <div class="field full">
              <label for="supervisorCreateAccessScope">Alcance del usuario</label>
              <select id="supervisorCreateAccessScope" name="accessScope" data-supervisor-create-scope="true">
                <% if (scopeOptions.canCreateAll) { %><option value="ALL" <%= defaultScope === 'ALL' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Todas las sucursales y vacantes</option><% } %>
                <% if (scopeOptions.actorScope !== 'VACANCY' && allowedCities.length) { %><option value="CITY" <%= defaultScope === 'CITY' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Sucursales seleccionadas</option><% } %>
                <% if (allowedVacancies.length) { %><option value="VACANCY" <%= defaultScope === 'VACANCY' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Vacantes seleccionadas</option><% } %>
              </select>
              <span class="hint">Solo puedes conceder un alcance igual o menor al que tú ya tienes.</span>
            </div>

            <div class="field full" data-supervisor-create-cities="true">
              <span>Sucursales</span>
              <div class="scope-options">
                <% for (const city of allowedCities) { %>
                  <label class="scope-option"><input type="checkbox" name="scopeCities" value="<%= city %>" <%= preselectActorScope ? 'checked' : '' %> data-supervisor-create-city="true" /><span><%= city %></span></label>
                <% } %>
                <% if (!allowedCities.length) { %><div class="hint">No hay sucursales disponibles dentro de tu alcance.</div><% } %>
              </div>
              <span class="hint">Con alcance por sucursal, el usuario verá las vacantes de las sucursales marcadas. Con alcance por vacantes, estas sucursales filtran la lista siguiente.</span>
            </div>

            <div class="field full" data-supervisor-create-vacancies="true">
              <span>Vacantes permitidas</span>
              <div class="scope-vacancy-list">
                <% for (const city of allowedCities) {
                  const cityVacancies = allowedVacancies.filter((vacancy) => vacancy.city === city);
                %>
                  <div class="scope-vacancy-group" data-supervisor-vacancy-city="<%= city %>">
                    <strong><%= city %></strong>
                    <% if (!cityVacancies.length) { %><div class="hint">Esta sucursal no tiene vacantes disponibles.</div><% } else { %>
                      <% for (const vacancy of cityVacancies) { %>
                        <label class="scope-option"><input type="checkbox" name="scopeVacancyIds" value="<%= vacancy.id %>" <%= scopeOptions.actorScope === 'VACANCY' ? 'checked' : '' %> /><span><%= vacancy.title || vacancy.role %></span></label>
                      <% } %>
                    <% } %>
                  </div>
                <% } %>
              </div>
              <span class="hint">Cuando eliges vacantes específicas, debes marcar al menos una.</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="create-section">
          <h3 class="create-section-title">Módulos y funciones</h3>
          <p class="hint">El rol queda fijo en Consulta. Habilita únicamente los módulos que necesita y, dentro de cada uno, sus funciones.</p>
          <div class="create-permissions" data-supervisor-create-permissions="true"><div class="hint">Cargando permisos disponibles…</div></div>
          <input type="hidden" name="operationalAccessConfig" data-supervisor-create-operational-config="true" value="" />
        </section>

        <div class="create-user-actions">
          <button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Crear usuario</button>
          <span class="hint">El código de recuperación se mostrará una sola vez después de crear la cuenta.</span>
        </div>
      </form>
    </section>

    <section class="card" data-supervisor-users-workspace="true">
      <h2>Permisos operativos del equipo</h2>
      <p class="hint">Puedes activar o desactivar los módulos operativos y sus funciones. No puedes cambiar roles, modificar otro Supervisor ni cambiar tus propios permisos.</p>
      <div class="supervisor-users-list" data-supervisor-users-list="true"><div class="empty">Cargando usuarios…</div></div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <script src="/public/supervisor-user-access.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>